        {
          "text": " Ido naadauniata agirokineta einer, abu kakoto aiwadik, konye abu keira eporoto loebuni kotoma akuj ebala ebe, “Kipucak nuenerata agirokineta akanykaarei, konye sirikiwadik ŋun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
